      "final_status": "translated",
      "source_preview": "Regarding the site accessibility, the RE informed the meeting that, as reported during the tripartite meeting on 12 th May 2026, securing a working space within the port is still difficult at present. Nevertheless, the…",
      "translated_preview": "关于现场可进入性，驻地工程师告知会议，正如2026年5月12日三方会议所报告的，目前仍难以在港内获得工作空间。尽管如此，业主承诺将继续与DP World跟进，一旦时机合适，便为承包商分配空间。随后，会议一致同意，坦桑尼亚港务局（TPA）将与DP World协调，提前为承包商的工人发放港口通行证，以便在情况允许开工时顺利进入。",
      "route_path": [
        "block_level",
        "direct_typst"
      ],
      "fallback_to": "",
      "degradation_reason": "",
      "error_types": []
    },
    {
